{"id":"lesson-1500","topicId":1500,"title":"江城子·乙卯正月二十日夜记梦/苏轼","sourceTitle":"高中語文 - 江城子·乙卯正月二十日夜记梦/苏轼","blockId":"xuanbi-shang","blockTitle":"選必上","forumUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/t/topic/1500","createdAt":"2024-08-07T02:59:24Z","updatedAt":"2025-11-24T05:04:58Z","postCount":11,"excerpt":"选自《东坡乐府笺》卷一(上海古籍出版社2009年版)。 这首词作于宋神宗熙宁八年(1075),是苏轼在密州(今山东诸城)做知州时悼念妻子王弗的作品。王弗去世于宋英宗治平二年(1065)。 十年生死两茫茫[1]。不思量,自难忘。 千里孤坟[2],无处话凄凉。 纵使相逢应不识,尘满面,鬓如霜。 夜来幽梦[3]忽还乡。小轩窗[4],正梳妆。 相顾无言,惟有泪千行。 料得年年肠断处,明月夜,短松冈[5]。 生死相隔,深情难忘。这首悼亡词一开篇便抒发作者对妻子诚笃的感情。 生死,是一种隔; 妻子葬于千里外的故乡,是一种隔; 岁月沧桑,即使相逢也认不出,又是一种隔; 梦中还乡,四目相对,千言万语无从谈起,还是一种隔。 在对梦境的淡淡追述中,将死别之悲、独处之苦、世路之艰写得极为沉痛。 诵读这首词,留意细节描写,体会作者是如何把梦境的记述、对亡妻的思念和落拓的身世之感融合在一起的。 生死相念,茫茫的是岁月时光,横亘的,是无变相思。 生死,有念","textbook":{"bookId":"高中_语文_普通高中教科书_语文选择性必修_上册","bookTitle":"普通高中教科书·语文选择性必修 上册（人教版）","imageBase":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76","tocLabel":"江城子·乙卯正月二十日夜记梦/苏轼","tocScore":1.03,"startPage":110,"pages":[110,111,112,113],"pageImages":[{"page":110,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p110.webp","label":"p110","matched":true},{"page":111,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p111.webp","label":"p111","matched":true},{"page":112,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p112.webp","label":"p112","matched":true},{"page":113,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p113.webp","label":"p113","matched":true}],"contextPages":[90,91,92,93,94,95,96,97,98,99,100,101,102,103,104,105,106,107,108,109,110,111,112,113],"contextPageImages":[{"page":90,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p90.webp","label":"p90","matched":false},{"page":91,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p91.webp","label":"p91","matched":false},{"page":92,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p92.webp","label":"p92","matched":false},{"page":93,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p93.webp","label":"p93","matched":false},{"page":94,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p94.webp","label":"p94","matched":false},{"page":95,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p95.webp","label":"p95","matched":false},{"page":96,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p96.webp","label":"p96","matched":false},{"page":97,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p97.webp","label":"p97","matched":false},{"page":98,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p98.webp","label":"p98","matched":false},{"page":99,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p99.webp","label":"p99","matched":false},{"page":100,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p100.webp","label":"p100","matched":false},{"page":101,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p101.webp","label":"p101","matched":false},{"page":102,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p102.webp","label":"p102","matched":false},{"page":103,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p103.webp","label":"p103","matched":false},{"page":104,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p104.webp","label":"p104","matched":false},{"page":105,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p105.webp","label":"p105","matched":false},{"page":106,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p106.webp","label":"p106","matched":false},{"page":107,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p107.webp","label":"p107","matched":false},{"page":108,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p108.webp","label":"p108","matched":false},{"page":109,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p109.webp","label":"p109","matched":false},{"page":110,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p110.webp","label":"p110","matched":true},{"page":111,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p111.webp","label":"p111","matched":true},{"page":112,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p112.webp","label":"p112","matched":true},{"page":113,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p113.webp","label":"p113","matched":true}]},"forumImages":[{"src":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/a/ac9d0b11a9630c14aa89f8f9a49102650bd4c4d9.jpeg","alt":"","width":522,"height":849,"postNumber":7},{"src":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/6/68a621792df31ad8c6b0474edb2a19ae8f0f89e8.jpeg","alt":"","width":937,"height":906,"postNumber":7}],"resources":[{"href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/%e4%b8%ad%e5%9b%bd%e5%8f%a4%e5%85%b8%e8%af%97%e6%ad%8c%e7%9a%84%e6%84%8f%e8%b1%a1/%e6%b1%9f%e5%9f%8e%e5%ad%90%e4%b9%99%e5%8d%af%e6%ad%a3%e6%9c%88%e4%ba%8c%e5%8d%81%e6%97%a5%e5%a4%9c%e8%ae%b0%e6%a2%a6%e8%8b%8f%e8%bd%bc","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/%e4%b8%ad%e5%9b%bd%e5%8f%a4%e5%85%b8%e8%af%97%e6%ad%8c%e7%9a%84%e6%84%8f%e8%b1%a1/%e6%b1%9f%e5%9f%8e%e5%ad%90%e4%","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/u/roast","text":"@Roast","kind":"link","postNumber":5},{"href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/t/3004/42","text":"如何表白?","kind":"link","postNumber":8},{"href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/t/topic/3055","text":"不生不死不茫茫","kind":"link","postNumber":9},{"href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/u/gggggg","text":"@gggggg","kind":"link","postNumber":9},{"href":"https://bdfz.yuque.com/org-wiki-bdfz-oz9uor/yrhg03/aqo192?singleDoc#","text":"江城子·乙卯正月二十日夜记梦/苏轼 · BDFZ","kind":"link","postNumber":11},{"href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/ykWTCYPnpF44GHcHsVeN2R8dnH5.pdf","text":"Pages from 钦定词谱.40卷.清.陈廷敬.王奕清等奉敕纂修.清康熙54年内府刊朱墨套印本.1715年.pdf","kind":"document","postNumber":12}],"resourceCounts":{"external":5,"document":2,"attachment":1},"annotations":[],"learningTasks":[],"posts":[{"id":10084,"post_number":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"created_at":"2024-08-07T02:59:24Z","updated_at":"2024-08-17T06:13:29Z","like_count":0,"cooked":"<blockquote>\n<p>选自《东坡乐府笺》卷一（上海古籍出版社2009年版）。</p>\n<p>这首词作于宋神宗熙宁八年（1075），是苏轼在密州（今山东诸城）做知州时悼念妻子王弗的作品。王弗去世于宋英宗治平二年（1065）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>十年生死两茫茫<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-10084-1\" id=\"footnote-ref-10084-1\">[1]</a></sup>。不思量，自难忘。</p>\n<p>千里孤坟<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-10084-2\" id=\"footnote-ref-10084-2\">[2]</a></sup>，无处话凄凉。</p>\n<p>纵使相逢应不识，尘满面，鬓如霜。</p>\n<p>夜来幽梦<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-10084-3\" id=\"footnote-ref-10084-3\">[3]</a></sup>忽还乡。小轩窗<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-10084-4\" id=\"footnote-ref-10084-4\">[4]</a></sup>，正梳妆。</p>\n<p>相顾无言，惟有泪千行。</p>\n<p>料得年年肠断处，明月夜，短松冈<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-10084-5\" id=\"footnote-ref-10084-5\">[5]</a></sup>。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>生死相隔，深情难忘。这首悼亡词一开篇便抒发作者对妻子诚笃的感情。</p>\n<p>生死，是一种隔；</p>\n<p>妻子葬于千里外的故乡，是一种隔；</p>\n<p>岁月沧桑，即使相逢也认不出，又是一种隔；</p>\n<p>梦中还乡，四目相对，千言万语无从谈起，还是一种隔。</p>\n<p>在对梦境的淡淡追述中，将死别之悲、独处之苦、世路之艰写得极为沉痛。</p>\n<p>诵读这首词，留意细节描写，体会作者是如何把梦境的记述、对亡妻的思念和落拓的身世之感融合在一起的。</p>\n<p>生死相念，茫茫的是岁月时光，横亘的，是无变相思。</p>\n<p>生死，有念；</p>\n<p>千里孤坟，一话或无话，是念；</p>\n<p>相守未终老，阴阳隔断，使尘鬓不识，但，我念。</p>\n<p>梦还乡，目相对，无言是念，泪行是念。</p>\n<p>明月是念，短松是念，肠断不断，我所念，皆是你。</p>\n<p>死生，无论，</p>\n<p>独偶，无计，</p>\n<p>世路利艰，无关。</p>\n<p>诵读这首词，留意细节描写，体会作者是如何把梦境的记述、对亡妻的思念和落拓的身世之感融合在一起的。</p><p></p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<small>This is a companion discussion topic for the original entry at <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/%e4%b8%ad%e5%9b%bd%e5%8f%a4%e5%85%b8%e8%af%97%e6%ad%8c%e7%9a%84%e6%84%8f%e8%b1%a1/%e6%b1%9f%e5%9f%8e%e5%ad%90%e4%b9%99%e5%8d%af%e6%ad%a3%e6%9c%88%e4%ba%8c%e5%8d%81%e6%97%a5%e5%a4%9c%e8%ae%b0%e6%a2%a6%e8%8b%8f%e8%bd%bc\">https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/%e4%b8%ad%e5%9b%bd%e5%8f%a4%e5%85%b8%e8%af%97%e6%ad%8c%e7%9a%84%e6%84%8f%e8%b1%a1/%e6%b1%9f%e5%9f%8e%e5%ad%90%e4%b9%99%e5%8d%af%e6%ad%a3%e6%9c%88%e4%ba%8c%e5%8d%81%e6%97%a5%e5%a4%9c%e8%ae%b0%e6%a2%a6%e8%8b%8f%e8%bd%bc</a></small><hr class=\"footnotes-sep\">\n\n<ol class=\"footnotes-list\">\n<li id=\"footnote-10084-1\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p> 两茫茫：指双方茫然不相知。 <a href=\"#footnote-ref-10084-1\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-10084-2\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p> 千里孤坟：王弗葬地在四川眉山，与苏轼任职的山东密州相距遥远，故称亡妻的坟为“千里孤坟”，有感伤自己不能与她同穴相伴之意。 <a href=\"#footnote-ref-10084-2\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-10084-3\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p> 幽梦：隐约迷离的梦。 <a href=\"#footnote-ref-10084-3\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-10084-4\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p> 轩窗：窗户。 <a href=\"#footnote-ref-10084-4\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-10084-5\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p> 短松冈：长着矮小松树的山冈，指王弗坟茔所在地。 <a href=\"#footnote-ref-10084-5\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>","plain_text":"选自《东坡乐府笺》卷一(上海古籍出版社2009年版)。 这首词作于宋神宗熙宁八年(1075),是苏轼在密州(今山东诸城)做知州时悼念妻子王弗的作品。王弗去世于宋英宗治平二年(1065)。 十年生死两茫茫[1]。不思量,自难忘。 千里孤坟[2],无处话凄凉。 纵使相逢应不识,尘满面,鬓如霜。 夜来幽梦[3]忽还乡。小轩窗[4],正梳妆。 相顾无言,惟有泪千行。 料得年年肠断处,明月夜,短松冈[5]。 生死相隔,深情难忘。这首悼亡词一开篇便抒发作者对妻子诚笃的感情。 生死,是一种隔; 妻子葬于千里外的故乡,是一种隔; 岁月沧桑,即使相逢也认不出,又是一种隔; 梦中还乡,四目相对,千言万语无从谈起,还是一种隔。 在对梦境的淡淡追述中,将死别之悲、独处之苦、世路之艰写得极为沉痛。 诵读这首词,留意细节描写,体会作者是如何把梦境的记述、对亡妻的思念和落拓的身世之感融合在一起的。 生死相念,茫茫的是岁月时光,横亘的,是无变相思。 生死,有念; 千里孤坟,一话或无话,是念; 相守未终老,阴阳隔断,使尘鬓不识,但,我念。 梦还乡,目相对,无言是念,泪行是念。 明月是念,短松是念,肠断不断,我所念,皆是你。 死生,无论, 独偶,无计, 世路利艰,无关。 诵读这首词,留意细节描写,体会作者是如何把梦境的记述、对亡妻的思念和落拓的身世之感融合在一起的。 This is a companion discussion topic for the original entry at https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/%e4%b8%ad%e5%9b%bd%e5%8f%a4%e5%85%b8%e8%af%97%e6%ad%8c%e7%9a%84%e6%84%8f%e8%b1%a1/%e6%b1%9f%e5%9f%8e%e5%ad%90%e4%b9%99%e5%8d%af%e6%ad%a3%e6%9c%88%e4%ba%8c%e5%8d%81%e6%97%a5%e5%a4%9c%e8%ae%b0%e6%a2%a6%e8%8b%8f%e8%bd%bc 两茫茫:指双方茫然不相知。 ↩︎ 千里孤坟:王弗葬地在四川眉山,与苏轼任职的山东密州相距遥远,故称亡妻的坟为“千里孤坟”,有感伤自己不能与她同穴相伴之意。 ↩︎ 幽梦:隐约迷离的梦。 ↩︎ 轩窗:窗户。 ↩︎ 短松冈:长着矮小松树的山冈,指王弗坟茔所在地。 ↩︎","images":[],"links":[{"href":"#footnote-10084-1","text":"[1]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-10084-2","text":"[2]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-10084-3","text":"[3]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-10084-4","text":"[4]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-10084-5","text":"[5]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/%e4%b8%ad%e5%9b%bd%e5%8f%a4%e5%85%b8%e8%af%97%e6%ad%8c%e7%9a%84%e6%84%8f%e8%b1%a1/%e6%b1%9f%e5%9f%8e%e5%ad%90%e4%b9%99%e5%8d%af%e6%ad%a3%e6%9c%88%e4%ba%8c%e5%8d%81%e6%97%a5%e5%a4%9c%e8%ae%b0%e6%a2%a6%e8%8b%8f%e8%bd%bc","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/%e4%b8%ad%e5%9b%bd%e5%8f%a4%e5%85%b8%e8%af%97%e6%ad%8c%e7%9a%84%e6%84%8f%e8%b1%a1/%e6%b1%9f%e5%9f%8e%e5%ad%90%e4%b9%99%e5%8d%af%e6%ad%a3%e6%9c%88%e4%ba%8c%e5%8d%81%e6%97%a5%e5%a4%9c%e8%ae%b0%e6%a2%a6%e8%8b%8f%e8%bd%bc","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-10084-1","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-10084-2","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-10084-3","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-10084-4","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-10084-5","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false}],"attachments":[]},{"id":10087,"post_number":2,"reply_to_post_number":null,"created_at":"2024-08-07T03:01:07Z","updated_at":"2024-08-07T03:01:07Z","like_count":0,"cooked":"<p><span class=\"mention\">@Creative_bot</span> 化身王弗，答一首同詞牌作品。</p>","plain_text":"@Creative_bot 化身王弗,答一首同詞牌作品。","images":[],"links":[],"attachments":[]},{"id":10089,"post_number":4,"reply_to_post_number":null,"created_at":"2024-08-07T03:01:12Z","updated_at":"2024-08-07T03:01:12Z","like_count":1,"cooked":"<p>十年生死两茫茫。不思君，自难忘。千里家园，无处诉衷肠。纵使重逢应不识，人憔悴，鬓染霜。</p>\n<p>梦里寻君影彷徨。小轩窗，旧时妆。相顾凝噎，忍泪湿红妆。料得君心悲戚处，明月夜，望家乡。</p>","plain_text":"十年生死两茫茫。不思君,自难忘。千里家园,无处诉衷肠。纵使重逢应不识,人憔悴,鬓染霜。 梦里寻君影彷徨。小轩窗,旧时妆。相顾凝噎,忍泪湿红妆。料得君心悲戚处,明月夜,望家乡。","images":[],"links":[],"attachments":[]},{"id":10973,"post_number":5,"reply_to_post_number":null,"created_at":"2024-08-14T06:05:38Z","updated_at":"2024-08-14T06:05:38Z","like_count":0,"cooked":"<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/roast\">@Roast</a> 這篇你怎麼說</p>","plain_text":"@Roast 這篇你怎麼說","images":[],"links":[{"href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/u/roast","text":"@Roast","title":"","classes":"mention","has_image":false}],"attachments":[]},{"id":10974,"post_number":6,"reply_to_post_number":null,"created_at":"2024-08-14T06:05:47Z","updated_at":"2024-08-14T06:05:47Z","like_count":0,"cooked":"<p>哎哟，十年生死两茫茫，还真是难为你了啊。又是千里孤坟，又是尘满面鬓如霜，不知道的还以为你写词呢，结果老婆一开口，感情你才是那个憔悴的？！下次煽情前先照照镜子吧，别光顾着自己悲戚，也不怕闪了腰。</p>","plain_text":"哎哟,十年生死两茫茫,还真是难为你了啊。又是千里孤坟,又是尘满面鬓如霜,不知道的还以为你写词呢,结果老婆一开口,感情你才是那个憔悴的?!下次煽情前先照照镜子吧,别光顾着自己悲戚,也不怕闪了腰。","images":[],"links":[],"attachments":[]},{"id":11073,"post_number":7,"reply_to_post_number":null,"created_at":"2024-08-17T06:14:08Z","updated_at":"2024-08-17T06:14:08Z","like_count":0,"cooked":"<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/a/ac9d0b11a9630c14aa89f8f9a49102650bd4c4d9.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/oD0AucQloHLwdbTMVBG7vFadH3r.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"\"><img src=\"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/a/ac9d0b11a9630c14aa89f8f9a49102650bd4c4d9.jpeg\" alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"oD0AucQloHLwdbTMVBG7vFadH3r\" width=\"522\" height=\"849\"></a></div><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/6/68a621792df31ad8c6b0474edb2a19ae8f0f89e8.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/eVLABBCg4bBphq2d9kD2iYlLCek.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"\"><img src=\"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/6/68a621792df31ad8c6b0474edb2a19ae8f0f89e8.jpeg\" alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"eVLABBCg4bBphq2d9kD2iYlLCek\" width=\"937\" height=\"906\"></a></div></p>","plain_text":"","images":[{"src":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/a/ac9d0b11a9630c14aa89f8f9a49102650bd4c4d9.jpeg","alt":"","width":522,"height":849,"base62":"oD0AucQloHLwdbTMVBG7vFadH3r"},{"src":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/6/68a621792df31ad8c6b0474edb2a19ae8f0f89e8.jpeg","alt":"","width":937,"height":906,"base62":"eVLABBCg4bBphq2d9kD2iYlLCek"}],"links":[{"href":"ht